# Edge case [T15, H]: a 5-node chain plus labeled skip-rank edges (a->c, a->e, b->e) and a back edge e->a; skip edges run alongside the intermediate nodes and must not cut through them or put labels on nodes.
dir DOWN
a[A]
b[B]
c[C]
